WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.754
Every match starts on Home.

2
00:00:01.804 --> 00:00:03.581
Tap "New match".

3
00:00:03.631 --> 00:00:06.294
"Official match": a game of the schedule, saved on the server.

4
00:00:06.344 --> 00:00:09.010
"Test match": practice with sample teams. Nothing is sent.

5
00:00:09.060 --> 00:00:11.727
"Easy match": Unofficial · no rosters or signatures.

6
00:00:11.777 --> 00:00:14.755
Here: "Test match".

7
00:00:14.805 --> 00:00:18.252
"Menu" → "Home" goes back. The match stays on this device.

8
00:00:18.302 --> 00:00:20.876
"Continue match" opens it again.

9
00:00:20.926 --> 00:00:26.046
"Delete match" removes it from this device.

10
00:00:26.096 --> 00:00:28.869
An official match: teams, score, last saved and its state.

11
00:00:28.919 --> 00:00:31.688
"Scoring here": the server knows this device scores it.

12
00:00:31.738 --> 00:00:38.738
No connection? Scoring goes on, on this device.

13
00:00:41.205 --> 00:00:44.045
"Unsent changes": not on the server yet. They are sent once online.

14
00:00:44.095 --> 00:00:46.046
Back online: sent.

15
00:00:46.096 --> 00:00:48.769
The "Game PIN" lets another device continue this match.

16
00:00:48.819 --> 00:00:54.807
"Restore match" loads a match from the server or from a backup file.
